sets/steam/apps/3498000/extras/c2e47248dee5c2c89e07201e097d4eb1.webm?t=1746115340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498000/extras/c2e47248dee5c2c89e07201e097d4eb1.mp4?t=1746115340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When diplomacy fails, rockets fly. Engage in strategic space combat as stations exchange fire and defend themselves in wars of attrition that will test your production capabilities and resource management. The faction with the strongest economy or largest number of trade partners will often prevail in this battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLANETARY DOMINATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure planets legally by purchasing them from the Galactic Union, or through violent military conquest. Each controlled planet provides unique strategic resources that can be used to create companies within specific industries such as: agriculture, military, media, or amenity. When a faction controls the majority of the planets in a given solar system - they gain governmental power, allowing them to dictate local tax policies and market regulations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498000/extras/9b0aa765bbc195d2f37068e8627730cf.avif?t=1746115340\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ECONOMIC STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your profits into other faction's industries through the stock exchange. Anticipate market shifts caused by wars, colonization efforts, and resource scarcity to maximize returns. Smart investors can turn modest profits into vast fortunes to fuel their galactic expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498000/extras/cd94bf00fc778b3198382ac1db7fd678.avif?t=1746115340\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR FUTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Back to Save the Universe, your path to galactic dominance is limited only by your ambition and strategy. Will you build a peaceful trading empire, establish military hegemony, or will you manipulate the political landscape from the shadows? The future of the universe is up to you.\u00a0</p>",
